<title>USA: Russell starts new fund.</title>
<headline>Russell starts new fund.</headline>
<dateline>TACOMA, Wash. 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Frank Russell Investment Management Co said it launched a specialized mutual fund that offers a way to minimize tax impacts.</p>
<p>It said Equity T Fund is a stock fund that intends to provide capital growth on an after-tax basis.</p>
<p>J.P. Morgan Investment Management Inc will manage the fund.</p>
<p>The fund opened Oct 7 with $6 million in assets.</p>
<p>Russell said stock trades &quot;will be carefully evaluated on an after-tax basis to determine whether they represent a long-term benefit&quot; to fund investors.</p>
<p>Russell has 23 funds with assets of about $8.3 billion.</p>
